## Changes Summary

| Endpoint Group | Changes |
|---|---|
| **Application Logs** | Added top-level `read()` and `list()` methods for general application logs |
| **System Logs** | Added `system` object with `read()` and `list()` methods |
| **AI Logs** | Moved existing endpoints under new `ai` namespace for better organization |
| **Structure** | Changed from flat to hierarchical: `ai.me()`, `ai.list()`, `ai.admin.list()`, etc. |

The refactored module now clearly separates three log types: application logs, system logs, and AI logs, with AI logs further organized by user and admin endpoints.

